        "date": "2026-09-06T16:49:31-05:00",
        "subject": "refactor(controller): use controller-runtime read-your-own-write cons… (#1998)",
        "body": "* refactor(controller): use controller-runtime read-your-own-write consistency\n\nUpgrade controller-runtime to v0.25 and enable\nEnableReadYourWritesConsistency on manager clients so cached reads wait\nfor prior writes to be observed. Remove the WebRequestCommitStatus\nResourceVersionTracker workaround and its tests.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: lint\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: codegen fix\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix(build): do not fail make when pinned tools are already installed\n\nThe go-install-tool helper used need_install && { install }, which\npropagates exit code 1 when no reinstall is needed and breaks targets\nlike controller-gen in CI deploy.\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Zach Aller <zachaller@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "sha": "c77005cc5c00628d8d04a49e05faec921cc3f47f",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
